<title>USA: Stratford seeks international sales boost.</title>
<headline>Stratford seeks international sales boost.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stratford Acquisition Corp said Monday that it has signed two agreements to market its cement and mortar admixture products internationally.</p>
<p>The company said Rollins International will assist in expanding its sales into Pacific Rim markets, including China and Latin America, through the creation of joint ventures and product and service distribution agreements.</p>
<p>Stratford also said it has signed a marketing agreement with Anand Purchasing Network, which has established market channels in the Philippines, Indonesia, Malaysia, and the Indian sub-continent.</p>
<p>Stratford makes an additive that enhances the performance of mortars.</p>
</text>
